  "text": "proprium.nativitas-sancti-ioannis-baptistae-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “Nativity of Saint John the Baptist” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "May Your Church, O God, rejoice at the birth of blessed John the Baptist, through whom she knew the author of her own rebirth, Your Son, our Lord Jesus Christ, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, forever and ever." },
    "s02": { "translation": "Amen." }
  },
